# 1. Prevent Directory Browsing
Options -Indexes

# 2. Protect .htaccess and sensitive files (parehas sa .env)
<FilesMatch "^\.">
    Require all denied
</FilesMatch>

# 3. Prevent XSS / Clickjacking (Gi-wrap sa IfModule para dili mag-error kung walay mod_headers)
<IfModule mod_headers.c>
    Header always set X-XSS-Protection "1; mode=block"
    Header always set X-Frame-Options "DENY"
    Header always set X-Content-Type-Options "nosniff"
</IfModule>

# 4. Disable Server Signatures (Aron dili makita sa hacker unsay version sa imong server)
ServerSignature Off